<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Refresh</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 8), Ranger (guild level 13, up to 70%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast refresh &lt;person&gt;
cast refresh             (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>The caster focuses on the target and infuses them with energy, giving 
back endurance so they can travel on and keep working when they would 
otherwise be too exhausted (see <a cmd='#'>Help Endurance Points</a>). How much varies 
a great deal: the better your skill in the spell, your divine power and 
your brain, the more, up to several hundred points for a master.
</p><p>It works on yourself, on other people and on mammals such as horses, but 
not on other kinds of creatures. It can be cast in a fight. It is also 
found on potions, scrolls and wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Endurance Points</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Druid Spells</a>
</pre>




</div>